msgid "Claude: ai-usage-collector --install-hooks (isolated profile: run it with each profile's CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR). Codex: busy comes from the session logs without installing anything; ai-usage-collector --install-hooks codex (optional) ends the busy state at the end of each turn and is what enables the sound/Notch on Codex (without it Codex only shows the state). If the state does not update, reinstall the package: pip install -e ."
msgstr "Claude: ai-usage-collector --install-hooks (isolated profile: run it with each profile's CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR). Codex: busy comes from the session logs without installing anything; ai-usage-collector --install-hooks codex (optional) ends the busy state at the end of each turn and is what enables the sound/Notch on Codex (without it Codex only shows the state). If the state does not update, reinstall the package: pip install -e ."

